<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile receives no bauxite offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile receives no bauxite offers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it received no offers for metallurgical grade bauxite in the offer announced April 22.</p>
<p>The next offer is May 20.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
